      "speaker_instance": "observer_adult",
      "voice_id": "observer_f5",
      "source_text": "kommer den att bli lika stor som högra hjärnhalvan.",
      "zh_text": "它会长得跟右脑半球一样大。",
      "start": 634.54,
      "end": 638.99,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "指着草图继续，右脑半球是比较尺度。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E056a",
      "source_ids": [
        "S056"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "observer",
      "speaker_instance": "observer_adult",
      "voice_id": "observer_f5",
      "source_text": "Det är på nätterna den växer.",
      "zh_text": "它是在夜里生长的。",
      "start": 639.07,
      "end": 641.53,
      "visible_speech": false,
      "delivery_note": "画面切到梅特翻找，仍是男性画外解说，重读夜里。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E056b",
      "source_ids": [
        "S056"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "observer",
      "speaker_instance": "observer_adult",
      "voice_id": "observer_f5",
      "source_text": "Och nu har jag fattat det igen.",
      "zh_text": "我现在又弄明白了。",
      "start": 642.08,
      "end": 644.14,
      "visible_speech": false,
      "delivery_note": "接着夜里生长的解释。后半句源声较含混。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E057",
      "source_ids": [
        "S057"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "mette",
      "speaker_instance": "mette_adult",
      "voice_id": "mette_f5",
      "source_text": "Ung man på sjuttio plus",
      "zh_text": "一位七十多岁的年轻男士，",
      "start": 686.91,
      "end": 688.68,
      "visible_speech": false,
      "delivery_note": "楼道镜头尾部先响起下一场床边读稿的声音，照文字念。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E058a",
      "source_ids": [
        "S058"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "mette",
      "speaker_instance": "mette_adult",
      "voice_id": "mette_f5",
      "source_text": "söker ung kvinna i samma ålder.",
      "zh_text": "想找一位同龄的年轻女士。",
      "start": 688.72,
      "end": 692.57,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "顺势接完征友启事，年轻和同龄都保留。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E058b",
      "source_ids": [
        "S058"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "mette",
      "speaker_instance": "mette_adult",
      "voice_id": "mette_f5",
      "source_text": "För promenader och samtal.",
      "zh_text": "一起散散步，聊聊天。",
      "start": 692.96,
      "end": 694.45,
      "visible_speech": false,
      "delivery_note": "照稿念想结伴做什么，镜头在听的人。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E059",
      "source_ids": [
        "S059"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "mette",
      "speaker_instance": "mette_adult",
      "voice_id": "mette_f5",
      "source_text": "Det låter väl inte så farligt?",
      "zh_text": "听起来也没那么吓人吧？",
      "start": 696.35,
      "end": 698.1,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "放下稿件的朗读语气，试着征求床上人的意见。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E060a",
      "source_ids": [
        "S060"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "marta",
      "speaker_instance": "marta_bedroom",
      "voice_id": "marta_f5",
      "source_text": "Jag tycker inte om att prata.",
      "zh_text": "我不爱说话。",
      "start": 699.13,
      "end": 701.64,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "枕上疲倦地拒绝交谈，低声。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E060b",
      "source_ids": [
        "S060"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "marta",
      "speaker_instance": "marta_bedroom",
      "voice_id": "marta_f5",
      "source_text": "Vi passar inte att skriva.",
      "zh_text": "写信也不合适。",
      "start": 701.91,
      "end": 703.96,
      "visible_speech": false,
      "delivery_note": "接着又拒绝动笔，低而短促。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E061",
      "source_ids": [
        "S061"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "marta",
      "speaker_instance": "marta_bedroom",
      "voice_id": "marta_f5",
      "source_text": "Jag vill sova.",
      "zh_text": "我想睡觉。",
      "start": 704.52,
      "end": 705.9,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "阖着眼往枕头里缩，只想休息。"
    },
    {
      "event_id": "E062",
      "source_ids": [
        "S062"
      ],
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker_id": "mette",
      "speaker_instance": "mette_adult",
      "voice_id": "mette_f5",
      "source_text": "Förlåt.",
      "zh_text": "对不起。",
      "start": 708.47,
      "end": 709.5,
      "visible_speech": true,
      "delivery_note": "床边轻声道歉，停下劝说。"
    }
  ]
}
